		{"id":"2c38fa7f1e60161b","type":"text","text":"# WebSockets\nFor real-time game chat and the game loop itself\n> real-time updates across clients, graceful connection/disconnection handling, and efficient message broadcasting","x":1160,"y":-2680,"width":335,"height":249},
		{"id":"f8b2ea5de905ebfb","type":"text","text":"# 3D Graphics with ThreeJS","x":67,"y":-2669,"width":346,"height":139},
		{"id":"53b188802b1f3d21","type":"text","text":"# Front-end Framework\nReact and ThreeJS","x":-316,"y":-2680,"width":324,"height":160},
		{"id":"51cde4cba94fbbd0","type":"text","text":"# Modules\n## 1. Web\nTotal points: 5\n- Use a framework for the backend and the frontend (React for frontend, NestJS for backend) - Major +2\n- Realtime features using WebSockets (real-time text chat) - Major +2\n- Use an ORM for the db (Prisma) - Minor +1\n## 3. User Management\nTotal points: 4 (6)\n- Standard user management and authentication - Major +2\n- Game stats and match history - Minor +1\n- OAuth 2.0 - Minor +1\n- (Organization system for guilds - Major +2)\n## 6. Gaming\nTotal points: 7 (10)\n- Complete web-based game (ONO card game) - Major +2\n- Remote players - Major +2\n- More than two players - Major +2\n- (Advanced 3D graphics with Three.js - Major +2)\n- (Tournament system - Minor +1)\n- Spectator mode - Minor +1","x":-156,"y":-3910,"width":694,"height":840},
